    "chunk_text": "(i) Sri Lanka Standard Specification for Reusable Plastic Bottles for Carrying Drinkable Liquids - SLS 1616\n\n(ii) Sri Lanka Standard Specification for Feeding Bottles Made of Polymer Materials - SLS 1306\n\nThis directive is subject to all future amendments made by the Sri Lanka Standards Institution to the above standards.\n\nThis Direction shall come into effect from 01st of April, 2026.\n\nBy Order of the Consumer Affairs Authority,\n\nHemantha Samarakoon, Chairman.\n\nColombo,01st October, 2025.\n\nEOG 10 - 0011\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
