    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'09'17Part IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 17.09.2025\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2456$61 - 2025 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 03 jeks isl=rdod - 2025'10'03No. 2456/61 - FRIDAY, OCTOBER 03, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPROVINCIAL COUNCIL NOTIFICATION OF NORTHERN PROVINCE\n\nCo-operative Societies Law No. 5 of 1972 as amended by Co-operative Societies (Amendment) Act, No. 32 of 1983 and the Co-operative Societies (Amendment) Act, No. 11 of 1992 read in conjunction with Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989\n\nConferment of Power\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Co-operative Societies Law No.5 of 1972 as amended by the Co-operative Societies (Amendment) Act. No.32 of 1983 and the Co-operative Societies (Amendment) Act, No.11 of 1992, read in conjunction with Provincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989. I, Mr. N.Vethanayahan, Governor of Northern Province, do hereby confer Miss. Segarajah Ahalya has been appointed as the Commissioner of Co-operative Development and Registrar of Co-opera tive Societies of the Northern Province to exercise such powers of the Registrar under the Co-operative Societies Law No.5 of 1972 as amended by Co-operative Societies (Amendment) Act, No.32 of 1983 and the Co-operative Societies (Amendment) Act, No.11 of 1992 and the rules there under in respect of the Northern Province, with effect from 25.08.2025 to be exercised by the aforesaid during her tenure of office.\n\nN. Vethanayahan Governor, Northern Province.\n\nEOG 10-0035\n\n1A - PG 7276 \u2014 14 (10/2025)\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
